<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Can't Take It</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The All-American Rejects</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Move Along</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0onviZ9vc2ftmVUDmnCIRU</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.400" end="00:20.710">You speak to me and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.710" end="00:25.740">I know this will be temporary</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.740" end="00:29.200">You ask to leave,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.200" end="00:32.990">but I can tell you that I've had enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.990" end="00:34.850" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.850" end="00:37.220">I can't take it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.220" end="00:39.560">This welcome is gone and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.560" end="00:45.770">I've waited long enough to make it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.770" end="00:47.850">and if you're so strong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.850" end="00:52.530">you might as well just do it alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.530" end="00:56.590">And I'll watch you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.590" end="01:02.920" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.920" end="01:06.370">Step up to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.370" end="01:11.190">I know that you've got something buried</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.190" end="01:14.600">I'll set you free</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.600" end="01:19.650">You set conditions, but I've had enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.650" end="01:21.150" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.410" end="01:22.920">I can't take it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.920" end="01:25.090">This welcome is gone and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.090" end="01:31.340">I've waited long enough to make it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.340" end="01:33.210">and if you're so strong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.210" end="01:38.000">you might as well just do it alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.000" end="01:39.740">And I'll watch you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.740" end="01:41.240" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.790" end="01:44.620">Come back home, won't you come back now?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.620" end="01:48.540">You're stepping lines, you got a lot to prove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.540" end="01:50.950">It comes and goes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.950" end="01:53.190">Yeah, it comes and goes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.190" end="01:56.470">A step in time, yeah it's a lot to move</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.470" end="02:00.200">I know this will be temporary</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.200" end="02:04.450">I know this will be temporary</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.450" end="02:08.620">I know this will be, but I've had enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.620" end="02:10.120" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.100" end="02:12.550">I can't take it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.550" end="02:14.830">This welcome is gone and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.830" end="02:20.850">I've waited long enough to make it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.850" end="02:23.510">and if you're so strong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.510" end="02:27.720">you might as well just do it alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.720" end="02:29.880">And I'll watch you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.880" end="02:31.380" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.880" end="02:33.290">I can't take it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.290" end="02:35.480">This welcome is gone and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.480" end="02:40.950">I've waited long enough to make it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.950" end="02:43.960">and if you're so strong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.960" end="02:48.270">you might as well just do it alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.270" end="02:52.270">And I'll watch you go</p></div></body></tt>